 "description": "Budding yeast size control by titration of nuclear sites\nBioModels BIOMD0000000856 (curated). SBML file: Heldt2018.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 720 time units (SED-ML: Heldt2018.sedml), sampling 1.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): MISMATCH_PARTIAL, max |difference| = 1.10e+03 of species peak (worst: TM)\nIndependent check of this deck (SciPy integration with Kintecus semantics) against the SBML: max |difference| = 1.10e+03 of species peak.\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [blocker] rate rule on compartment 'mV' (variable volume) not convertible\n  [blocker] rate rule on compartment 'dV' (variable volume) not convertible\n  [partial] compartment 'tV' has an assignment rule; its t=0 size is used\n  [blocker] event 'Start' not converted (state-triggered (not a time >= t0 trigger))\n  [blocker] event 'Division' not converted (state-triggered (not a time >= t0 trigger))\n  [info] species 'GI' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] species 'GD' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] species 'SBF' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] species 'WHIt' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] species 'SBFt' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] species 'TMt' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] species 'active_SBF' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] species 'CLN3t' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] Synthesis_of_Cln1_2 term 2/4: rate order differs from the stoichiometry; consumed on separate line(s) - CLN: zero order, signed\n  [info] Synthesis_of_Cln1_2 term 3/4: rate order differs from the stoichiometry; consumed on separate line(s) - CLN